flowchart LR
  Workbook[Source workbook<br/>client tabs, mixed headers and notes]

  subgraph Import[Import and configuration]
    Py[Python normalizer<br/>offline reference]
    TS[In-app TypeScript importer<br/>dry run, diff, human approval]
    Config[(vertical_config<br/>source_tabs)]
    Parity[Python ↔ TypeScript parity tests]
    Workbook --> Py
    Workbook --> TS
    Config --> TS
    Py --> Parity
    TS --> Parity
  end

  subgraph Enrichment[Optional enrichment; suggestions only]
    Notes[Deal notes]
    Extract[Deterministic date extraction]
    LLM[LLM suggestions<br/>evidence and confidence]
    Review[Human review<br/>accept, edit, dismiss]
    Notes --> Extract
    Notes -. optional .-> LLM
    Extract --> Review
    LLM --> Review
  end

  subgraph Cloud[Supabase cloud · one source of truth]
    DB[(Postgres<br/>deals · raw values · provenance<br/>history · roles/RLS · imports)]
    Geo[Geocoding + Census ACS<br/>cached tract data]
    DB <--> Geo
  end

  Parity -->|validated import| DB
  Review -->|approved suggestion only| DB

  subgraph Product[Vercel · Next.js application]
    Ops[Operations<br/>grid · edits · map]
    Weekly[Weekly Review<br/>live view · PPTX]
    Admin[Admin<br/>users · audit · config · import]
    Rollup[Rollup<br/>vertical × stage · outreach]
  end
  DB <--> Ops
  DB <--> Weekly
  DB <--> Admin
  DB <--> Rollup
  Geo --> Ops

  subgraph Delivery[Quality and delivery]
    CI[GitHub CI<br/>pytest · lint · typecheck · Vitest parity · build]
    E2E[Playwright acceptance suite<br/>isolated sessions · restore/hash check]
    Deploy[Vercel deployment<br/>main → production · PR → preview]
  end
  DB --> E2E
  CI --> Deploy
  E2E -. manual workflow .-> Deploy
